              "id": "ch07.s05.b001",
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "The café has a zinc counter, marble tables and croissants. Across one table lies taped tracing paper in four inks: the streets of the fifth in grey, and under them, in black and red and blue, something like the roots of a tree.",
